    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="El. 34">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> El. 34</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Þa wuduwan ⁊ þa stiopcild ne sceððað ge, ne hie nawer deriað. Gif ge þonne elles doð, hie cleopiað to me, ⁊ ic gehiere hie ⁊ ic eow þonne slea mid minum sweorde ⁊ ic gedó, þæt eowru wif beoð wydewan ⁊ eowru bearn beoð steopcild.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Widows and orphans you will not harm, nor will you ever hurt them. If you do otherwise, they will cry out to me, and I will hear them and I will then strike you with my sword; and I will arrange that your wives will be widows and your children will be orphans.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ða wydewan ⁊ þa steopcyld ne scyþþað, ⁊ ne hy nawer deriað. Gif ge þonne elles doð, hy clipiað to me, ⁊ ic gehire hy ⁊ ic eow ðonne slea mid minum sweorde ⁊ ic eow gedó, þæt eowre wif beoð wudewan ⁊ eowre bearn steopcyld.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
